IF from email contains `orders@casewine.example` OR subject contains `([Casewinelife.com Order Wine Online] Order #)`
THEN update status to Closed

I used an OR condition to match either the sender address or the subject pattern. Let me know if this matches your intent or if you need any adjustments.

```json
{
  "trigger": "New conversation (inbound) received",
  "conditions": [
    {"field": "From Email", "operator": "contains", "value": "orders@casewine.example"},
    {"field": "Subject", "operator": "contains", "value": "([Casewinelife.com Order Wine Online] Order #)"}
  ],
  "logic": "OR",
  "actions": [
    {"type": "Update Status", "value": "Closed"}
  ]
}
```

